# Commit and push

After completing requested site changes (and a successful build when applicable):

1. Create a git commit with a concise message focused on why
2. Push to the remote tracking branch (`git push -u origin HEAD` if needed)

Do this without waiting to be asked. Skip only if the user explicitly says not to commit or push for that change.
